WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.684 --> 00:00:09.064
Imagine the whole SI industry, seated at one long table.

2
00:00:09.764 --> 00:00:22.904
First, the model builders. Anthropic's Dario Amodei. OpenAI's Greg Brockman. Google's Sundar Pichai. Meta's Mark Zuckerberg. And Elon Musk, of xAI.

3
00:00:23.524 --> 00:00:33.464
Then the chipmakers. Nvidia's Jensen Huang. AMD's Lisa Su. Broadcom's Hock Tan. And Micron's Sanjay Mehrotra.

4
00:00:34.031 --> 00:00:39.544
The cloud. Microsoft's Satya Nadella, and Amazon founder Jeff Bezos.

5
00:00:40.124 --> 00:00:47.784
Security and defense software. Palantir's Alex Karp and Shyam Sankar, and Palo Alto Networks' Nikesh Arora.

6
00:00:48.084 --> 00:00:50.744
Some of the investors who help fund it all.

7
00:00:51.084 --> 00:00:58.184
And the government. The President, Vice President JD Vance, Speaker Mike Johnson, and members of the cabinet.

8
00:00:58.404 --> 00:01:02.904
31 guests in all, according to the guest list reported by Axios.

9
00:01:03.124 --> 00:01:09.544
Most of these companies compete every day. On Tuesday, they shared one table.
